      "summaries": {
        "en": "Flowsurface is a native desktop charting platform specifically designed for cryptocurrency markets, addressing the need for reliable, high-performance visualization of real-time orderbook and tick data. Built with Rust and the Iced GUI framework, it leverages systems programming strengths to handle high-frequency data streams efficiently while maintaining responsive user interfaces. Developers can use it to analyze market microstructure, extend its charting capabilities, or study how Rust enables robust financial applications beyond web-based tools.",
        "zh": "Flowsurface 是一款专为加密货币市场设计的原生桌面图表平台，解决了实时订单簿和逐笔数据可视化对性能与可靠性的需求。该项目采用 Rust 语言和 Iced GUI 框架开发，通过系统级编程优势高效处理高频数据流，同时保持界面响应流畅。其架构展示了如何利用 Rust 的内存安全与并发特性构建稳定的金融应用，避免了传统 Web 工具在实时数据处理中的延迟问题。开发者可借此平台深入分析市场微观结构，扩展图表功能，或学习 Rust 在金融科技领域的实践应用。",
        "es": "Flowsurface is a native desktop charting platform specifically designed for cryptocurrency markets, addressing the need for reliable, high-performance visualization of real-time orderbook and tick data. Built with Rust and the Iced GUI framework, it leverages systems programming strengths to handle high-frequency data streams efficiently while maintaining responsive user interfaces. Developers can use it to analyze market microstructure, extend its charting capabilities, or study how Rust enables robust financial applications beyond web-based tools.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "flowsurface stands out for cryptocurrency, iced, and orderbook-tick-data in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Flowsurface is a native desktop charting platform specifically designed for cryptocurrency markets, addressing the need for reliable, high-performance visualization of real-time orderbook and tick data. Built with Rust and the Iced GUI framework, it leverages systems programming strengths to handle high-frequency data streams efficiently while maintaining responsive user interfaces. Developers can use it to analyze market microstructure, extend its charting capabilities, or study how Rust enables robust financial applications beyond web-based tools.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/flowsurface-rs/flowsurface for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
